      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BRUNSWICK BOY (7) goes very well at the distance with four wins and a placing from nine starts. Below best last time at this track (23.85) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 6 length fourth. Looks the one to beat with even luck. KINGSBRAE NOLA (1) was in the minors two back (17.30) at this track but ran below best last time there, finishing 6th. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Goes well out of this box with a win and five minor placings. Has the ability to give this a shake. WAVY WEB SURF (2) has been in the frame at his last two runs, most recently when third (23.70) in a Grade 4/5 over 411m at this track. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. BURNSIDE BOOKIE (6) profiles nicely over this trip.",
